<title>USA: VTEL names Jerry Benson president.</title>
<headline>VTEL names Jerry Benson president.</headline>
<dateline>AUSTIN, Texas 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>VTEL Corp and Compression Labs Inc said Thursday that they have named Jerry Benson president and chief operating officer.</p>
<p>Benson's appointment is effective May 23, 1997, the same day that VTEL and Compression Labs stockholders will vote on the proposed merger of the two videoconferencing companies.</p>
<p>Benson was previously president and chief operating officer of NEC Technologies Inc.</p>
